    "body_normalized": "## Description\nIn the Debugger variables panel, variables whose value evaluates to 0 are not rendered correctly.\n\n<img width=\"2152\" height=\"586\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/17f6fb98-7fa0-4ae3-91f0-f74fa692379b\" />\n\n## Reproduce\nJust create a variable with value 0 and try to view it in the debugger variable panel.\n\n## Expected behavior\n\n0 should be rendered like other variables\n\n## Context\n\n<!--Complete the following for context, and add any other relevant context-->\n- Browser and version: Chrome\n- JupyterLab version:  4.4.0a2",
    "body_raw": "\n\n## Description\nIn the Debugger variables panel, variables whose value evaluates to 0 are not rendered correctly.\n\n<img width=\"2152\" height=\"586\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/17f6fb98-7fa0-4ae3-91f0-f74fa692379b\" />\n\n## Reproduce\nJust create a variable with value 0 and try to view it in the debugger variable panel.\n\n## Expected behavior\n\n0 should be rendered like other variables\n\n## Context\n\n<!--Complete the following for context, and add any other relevant context-->\n- Browser and version: Chrome\n- JupyterLab version:  4.4.0a2",
